===== STAGE102 HOST TESTS =====
===== STAGE102 XNU THREAD-CALL + TOKEN LIFECYCLE SOURCE AUDIT =====
PASS: XNU_CANCEL_WAIT_CAVEAT_PRESENT_IN_TARGET_SDK: target MacKernelSDK documents that cancel_wait may return with later invocations in flight
PASS: XNU_THREAD_CALL_ISACTIVE_AVAILABLE: target MacKernelSDK exposes pending-or-executing state query
PASS: XNU_ISACTIVE_CONTRACT_DOCUMENTED: isactive includes both pending and executing invocations
PASS: GENERIC_REAPER_CLOSES_PRODUCER_GATE: no producer can publish after shutdown closes the gate
PASS: GENERIC_REAPER_JOINS_ACTIVE_PRODUCERS: producer reservation includes the enqueue and thread_call_enter operation
PASS: GENERIC_REAPER_CANCELS_THEN_POLLS_ISACTIVE: cancel_wait is followed by an isactive join before final consumption
PASS: GENERIC_REAPER_FINAL_DRAIN_BEFORE_FREE: only the passive final consumer drains after call quiescence and before freeing call storage
PASS: GENERIC_REAPER_RETURNS_FAILURE_ON_INCOMPLETE_DRAIN: incomplete ownership remains fail-closed
PASS: COMPAT_EXIT_USES_REAPER_JOIN: global locks/callbacks are not released before the reaper join
PASS: COMPAT_HEADER_EXPOSES_REAPER_QUIESCE: WCL teardown can explicitly drain generic skb ownership before token worker shutdown
PASS: BOUNDED_QUEUE_DEQUEUE_POSITION_ATOMIC: single-consumer cursor reads/writes are also race-safe to observers
PASS: BOUNDED_QUEUE_EMPTY_USES_ATOMIC_CURSOR: concurrent token/teardown observers do not race a plain cursor read
PASS: WCL_TOKEN_RETIRE_USES_BOUNDED_MPSC: token retirement uses sequence-numbered queue rather than an intrusive list
PASS: TOKEN_COUNT_PRECEDES_PUBLICATION: teardown cannot miss token ownership during the publication interval
PASS: TOKEN_QUEUE_OVERFLOW_FAILS_CLOSED: queue-full retains outstanding count and quarantines token instead of freeing in callback context
PASS: TOKEN_REAPER_IS_SOLE_QUEUE_CONSUMER: token memory is freed only by deferred/passive single consumer
PASS: TOKEN_RETIRED_STATE_INCLUDES_QUARANTINE: a quarantined overflow token continues to block unbind/stop
PASS: ADAPTER_UNBIND_JOINS_COMPLETION_CALLBACKS: adapter unbind waits ticket and backend callback/token ownership
PASS: WORKER_STOP_REQUIRES_CALLBACK_AND_TOKEN_QUIESCENCE: worker refuses to stop while a ticket, token or backend completion callback exists
PASS: WORKLOOP_AND_TIMER_CALLBACKS_HAVE_ADMISSION_GATE: checkForWork, notifier and timer callbacks are counted around worker access
PASS: WORKER_STOP_CLOSES_CALLBACK_ADMISSION: all event and timer callback entrants are joined before worker storage is released
PASS: WORKER_STOP_REMOVES_EVENT_SOURCES_BEFORE_JOIN: retry timer and workloop source are detached before callback gate join
PASS: WORKER_CANCEL_WAIT_FOLLOWED_BY_ISACTIVE_JOIN: no thread-call storage or worker owner is freed while a later invocation remains active
PASS: WORKER_FINAL_TOKEN_DRAIN_AFTER_THREADCALL_JOIN: final passive token drain follows call join and precedes retire-hook removal
PASS: WORKER_SCHEDULER_ONLY_FROM_GATED_EVENT_SOURCE: the only scheduler invocation is inside counted checkForWork
PASS: CONTROLLER_STOPS_RADIO_AND_FENCES_PCI_BEFORE_QUIESCE: hardware producers are stopped/fenced before callback admission closes
PASS: CONTROLLER_DRAINS_GENERIC_SKBS_BEFORE_ADAPTER_UNBIND: deferred skb destruction may still publish WCL tokens while worker is alive
PASS: CONTROLLER_UNBINDS_ADAPTER_BEFORE_STOPPING_WORKER: worker is stopped only after all tickets and backend callbacks have returned
PASS: TOKEN_RELEASE_PRECEDES_BACKEND_COMPLETION: token becomes visible to retirement accounting before completion callback can wake teardown
PASS: THREAD_CALL_ENTER_RESULT_NOT_TREATED_AS_FAILURE: TRUE means already pending; it is not interpreted as an error
PASS: THREAD_CALLS_ALLOCATED_WITH_SUPPORTED_API: both reapers use an allocation form supported by cancel_wait/free
PASS_COUNT=31
FAIL_COUNT=0
XNU_CANCEL_WAIT_POLICY=ALWAYS_FOLLOWED_BY_ISACTIVE_JOIN
TOKEN_RECLAMATION=SEQUENCE_MPSC_WITH_FAIL_CLOSED_OVERFLOW
STAGE102_RESULT=PASS_STATIC_REVIEW
THREAD_CALL_CANCEL_WAIT_EDGE_MODEL=PASS
PRODUCER_ADMISSION_CLOSE_AND_JOIN_MODEL=PASS_12_PRODUCERS
